{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim, great to see you! Any new success stories?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-2d4d1bdf62a0ff84cce7fdb0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.149554+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d4d1bdf62a0ff84cce7fdb0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d4d1bdf62a0ff84cce7fdb0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John, I had a tough time with my English lit class. Did an analysis on this series and I think it went ok!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-9f7f3ab86258fabc390ed4e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.179387+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9f7f3ab86258fabc390ed4e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9f7f3ab86258fabc390ed4e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! It's a bummer about your English lit class, but you did your best. By the way, I had a career-high in assists last Friday in our big game against our rival. Yay!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-303cd338fc021db2c5b19892", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.207565+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "303cd338fc021db2c5b19892", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "303cd338fc021db2c5b19892", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Congrats! That's awesome. How did it feel being out there making those plays?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-2efe2ffcd0d096127675a9de", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.229063+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2efe2ffcd0d096127675a9de", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2efe2ffcd0d096127675a9de", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! It felt great being out there, making plays for my team. I love seeing my teammates succeed because of the opportunities I create for them. The atmosphere in the arena was really electric and playing against our rivals added an extra level of intensity. It was a memorable night!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-953d2e8012b99b7c2855001c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.252056+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "953d2e8012b99b7c2855001c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "953d2e8012b99b7c2855001c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Sounds incredible! Must have been quite an atmosphere. Have you had any other games that were as thrilling as this one?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-ea739ea194c616bb201fc664", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.273446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea739ea194c616bb201fc664", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea739ea194c616bb201fc664", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've had some thrilling games in my career. My favorite was when we were down 10 in the 4th and I hit the buzzer-beater shot to win. The atmosphere was incredible and it was such a thrilling experience. Those moments make me love basketball so much."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-616d4afeaa661eaec986f536", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.292304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "616d4afeaa661eaec986f536", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "616d4afeaa661eaec986f536", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow, John! Moments like that make us love sports, huh? I still think about this pic you sent me a while back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-1aa5f3c0a6ffc4da592a9631", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.310325+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1aa5f3c0a6ffc4da592a9631", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1aa5f3c0a6ffc4da592a9631", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, that pic reminds me of when I was younger. I'd practice basketball outside for hours, dreaming of playing in big games. It was my way of dealing with doubts and stress. It's amazing how a ball and hoop can be so powerful, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-40e55f96a239e72a40747c6c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.334627+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40e55f96a239e72a40747c6c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40e55f96a239e72a40747c6c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Yeah! Sports are the best. When we're feeling down, it's a way to express ourselves and stay positive. It's awesome how much basketball has done for you. Keep going with your dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-6beb150fff44647ebbdf72c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.351471+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6beb150fff44647ebbdf72c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6beb150fff44647ebbdf72c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Appreciate the support. It's been a significant part of my life and allows me to be myself and pursue my passions. Gonna keep chasing my dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-2dac1a2e7a3218cdbd2a41fa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.373665+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2dac1a2e7a3218cdbd2a41fa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2dac1a2e7a3218cdbd2a41fa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! It's really important to do our own thing and follow our dreams. Keep it up, you're gonna do amazing things!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-95ef0d58140bf0e91b3a6f36", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.393157+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95ef0d58140bf0e91b3a6f36", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95ef0d58140bf0e91b3a6f36", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Your encouragement means a lot. Let's keep pushing and following our dreams - we can make a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-273220c26d7d631dde867685", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.415073+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "273220c26d7d631dde867685", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "273220c26d7d631dde867685", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Definitely. We both have so much potential! Let's keep supporting each other on our journey towards our dreams."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-2d73a72fa2e41c903505e86e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.436157+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d73a72fa2e41c903505e86e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d73a72fa2e41c903505e86e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, you're super inspiring and motivating. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-43a5c46ff681e94c6805f9cc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.453606+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "43a5c46ff681e94c6805f9cc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "43a5c46ff681e94c6805f9cc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks, it means a lot. Let's keep each other motivated. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_23-905d3d43367001e12b86e18d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:32:52.472549+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "905d3d43367001e12b86e18d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "905d3d43367001e12b86e18d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
